package CanvasNet {
    part def Ticks {
        doc /* The internal static Ticks, a port with attribution of the d3-array tick algorithms and the d3-scale linear nice method plus the tick-count rules of Vega and Vega-Lite: GetTicks, TickIncrement (d3's signed encoding, in which a negative value stands for the reciprocal of the step, which keeps the arithmetic exact), and TickStep choose evenly spaced ticks that are 1, 2, or 5 times a power of ten with the thresholds sqrt(50), sqrt(10), and sqrt(2); Nice extends a domain to nice boundaries (at most ten rounds until the step settles, direction kept, unchanged when it does not settle); DefaultAxisTickCount is Vega-Lite's one tick per 40 pixels, DefaultAxisTickMinStep is 1 for the integer format d, ResolveTickCount is Vega's tickCount that lowers the count until the step reaches the minimum step, and AxisTicks combines them. A result of more than MaxTicks values is a VegaLiteRenderException thrown before the array is allocated; inputs that are not numbers give an empty array or an unchanged domain. ModelTicks dispatches by the transform of a scale model (the ordinary ticks for linear, pow, sqrt, and symlog, as in d3), LogTicks is the ticks method of d3's scaleLog (the multiples of every power inside the domain, the d3 ticks of the exponents for a wide domain, reflected for a domain below zero, bounded by MaxTicks and a work limit of a hundred times it, polling the cancellation token), LogNice floors and ceils a log domain to powers of the base, LogLabelTest is the label filter of Vega's tickLog (max(1, base * count / ticks) on the leading digit, judged on the magnitude), and ResolveTickCount does not lower the count by the step for a log scale. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Scales/Ticks.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Scales/TicksTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/scales/ticks.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/scales/ticks.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/scales/ticks.yaml */
    }
}
